# Modified 2026-10 by PLN: MSD gate is every pikvm_msd_* tool except status (GPL-3.0; see NOTICE).
# Modified 2026-10 by PLN: PIKVM_MSD_LOCAL_DIR and PIKVM_MSD_MAX_BYTES (GPL-3.0; see NOTICE).
